# Cerebro — Agentic Personal OS

Local AI desktop app. Python backend (FastAPI) + React/Tauri frontend communicating over HTTP on **port 7842**.

## Entry Point
`main.py` wires inference providers, memory stores, and agent runtime → injects into `app_state` in `ui/tray/server.py` → starts Uvicorn.

## Backend (`cerebro/core/`)
| Directory | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `agents/` | LangGraph agent execution; `llm_router.py` classifies query → picks general/academic/code agent |
| `inference/` | `registry.py` holds primary+fallback providers; `model_manager.py` manages llama.cpp subprocesses |
| `inference/providers/` | `llamacpp_provider.py`, `mlx_provider.py` |
| `memory/` | `short_term.py` (in-session), `long_term.py` (LanceDB vector), `context_builder.py` |
| `tools/` | Agent tools (calendar, filesystem, search, shell); `policy.py` controls which need confirmation |
| `pipeline/stages/` | Per-request stages: intent → context → prompt → policy → audit |
| `rag/` | `query_engine.py` — vector similarity search |
| `ingestion/` | PDF/DOCX → chunk → embed → LanceDB |
| `watcher/` | Watchdog FS monitor → triggers re-index |
| `scheduler/` | APScheduler proactive tasks |

## REST API (`ui/tray/server.py`) — all routes under `/api`
- `POST /api/query` — sync query
- `POST /api/query/stream` — SSE streaming (tokens → metadata → `[DONE]`)
- `POST /api/tool-confirm` — approve/deny pending tool call
- `POST /api/index` / `GET /api/index/status` — async indexing
- `GET /api/status` — RAM, latency, model, provider
- `GET/PATCH /api/config` — persistent config
- `GET /api/conversations[/{id}]` — conversation history
- `GET /api/models` — available GGUF + MLX models
- `GET/POST /api/wizard/*` — first-launch onboarding

**Tool confirmation flow**: agent pauses → returns `metadata.pending_tool` → frontend shows `ConfirmModal` → user sends decision to `POST /api/tool-confirm`.

## Frontend (`ui/tray/src/`)
React 18 + TypeScript + Zustand + Tauri.
- `api/client.ts` — all fetch calls to backend
- `api/types.ts` — TS types mirroring backend Pydantic models
- `stores/` — `chat.ts`, `history.ts`, `settings.ts`, `system.ts`, `wizard.ts`
- `components/chat/` — ChatWindow, InputArea, MessageBubble, HistoryPanel, ConfirmModal
- `components/settings/` — SettingsPanel, ModelSelector, FolderManager
- `components/status/` — StatusBar, RamGauge, LatencyBadge
- `layouts/` — MainLayout.tsx, Header.tsx

## Dev Commands
```bash
make run          # start backend on :7842
make test         # pytest (all mocked, no live service needed)
make lint         # black + ruff + mypy
make engine       # start llama.cpp server on :8080
cd ui/tray && npm run dev    # frontend dev server (Vite + Tauri)
```

## Code Style
- Python: Black 100ch, py3.11; Ruff rules E,F,I,UP; Mypy `warn_return_any=true`
- Tests: one file per module in `tests/`; mock via `AppState` injection; `asyncio_mode = auto`
- Frontend: TypeScript strict; Zustand for state; no inline styles

## Key Env Vars
```
CEREBRO_PORT=7842
CEREBRO_INFERENCE_BACKEND=llamacpp   # or mlx
CEREBRO_LLAMACPP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
CEREBRO_LLAMACPP_SIMPLE=false        # true = single server mode
CEREBRO_DB=~/.cerebro/db
CEREBRO_STATE=~/.cerebro/state
```
